# vat writes every file it generates with LF, on every platform: the manifest,
# the harness adapters, the brain records, the changesets. Left to its own
# devices git converts them to CRLF on a Windows checkout, and the next
# `vat harness render` rewrites all of them back — so the working tree is dirty
# on arrival and drift detection reports files nobody touched.
#
# It is not only cosmetic. The suite reads the committed adapters and compares
# them with what the generator produces, which is a byte comparison; CI caught
# it on windows-latest the first time that test ran there.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries git must not touch.
*.png binary
*.svg text eol=lf
